  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Shielding the Truth: Investigative Journalism with a Data and Safety-First Approach</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project seeks to strengthen the investigative journalism landscape by focusing on capacity building, collaboration, and sustainability. Through training, it equips journalists with essential skills and tools to produce impactful and data-driven stories. By fostering regional connections and offering tailored support packages to organizations, the initiative helps sustain and expand their operations, fostering long-term impact. Additionally, the project prioritizes safety resources to ensure journalists can work securely, contributing to a more informed and engaged public</narrative>
  </description>
